  <!--
    No entry for KumikoUI.Core, KumikoUI.SkiaSharp or KumikoUI.Uno (UNO-22, #76). The libraries are trim-safe
    (IsAotCompatible): item properties are read through accessors the [KumikoGridItem] source generator emits at
    build time, not through reflection, so the trimmer needs no hint to keep them. The sample's row types carry
    [KumikoGridItem], and a PublishTrimmed build with TrimMode=full (the CI job) turns the reflection fallback off,
    so a missing accessor would show up as empty cells instead of being hidden by a preserved assembly.
  -->

